# 最小化冻结游戏时钟（第二阶段 112400c，Mac）：最小化 4 秒，还原后游戏拍只走了零头（不冻的话还原时一口气补跑约 100 拍，人站着挨打）
# Minimize freezes the game clock (phase 2, 112400c, Mac): minimized for 4 s, after restoring the game has advanced only a few ticks (without the freeze it would catch up about 100 ticks in one burst on restore, the character standing still)
name minimize_freezes_clock
requires cli mac-app
save warlock
timeout 180

enter_game
remember tick
background for=4
expect_state tick<=$tick+30 in_game=true
quit
check no_red
check no_red_log
